@page
@model PrivacyModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}
<div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-10 md:py-16 max-w-2xl">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-2 font-display">@ViewData["Title"]</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-ink-light mb-8">Last updated: November 1, 2026</p>

    <div class="flex flex-col gap-8 text-ink-light leading-relaxed">
        <section>
            <p>
                Glimpses of Glory ("we", "us", "our") respects your privacy. This policy explains what
                personal information we collect when you visit our shop or place an order, how we use it,
                and the choices you have.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 font-display text-ink">Information we collect</h2>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 flex flex-col gap-2">
                <li>
                    <strong class="text-ink">Order details</strong> &mdash; your email address, name, shipping
                    address and the items you buy, so we can fulfill and deliver your order.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong class="text-ink">Payment information</strong> &mdash; card payments are processed
                    securely by <a href="https://stripe.com/privacy" class="text-gold-dark hover:underline" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Stripe</a>.
                    Your card number is entered on Stripe's systems and never reaches or is stored on our servers.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong class="text-ink">Checkout details</strong> &mdash; if you start checkout but don't
                    finish, we keep the details you entered for a limited time so we can remind you about your cart.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong class="text-ink">Technical information</strong> &mdash; like most websites, our servers
                    record basic information such as your IP address and browser type for security and troubleshooting.
                </li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 font-display text-ink">How we use your information</h2>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 flex flex-col gap-2">
                <li>To process, ship and arrange pickup of your orders.</li>
                <li>To send you order confirmations, shipping updates and other emails about your purchase.</li>
                <li>To send a reminder if you leave items behind at checkout.</li>
                <li>To respond to your questions and provide customer support.</li>
                <li>To prevent fraud and keep our shop secure.</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="mt-3">
                We do not sell, rent or trade your personal information, and we do not send marketing
                newsletters unless you ask us to.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 font-display text-ink">Who we share it with</h2>
            <p>
                We share only what is needed to run the shop with trusted service providers: our payment
                processor (Stripe), our email delivery provider, our hosting provider, and the shipping
                carrier that delivers your order. They may use your information only to provide their
                services to us. We may also disclose information when required by law.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 font-display text-ink">Cookies</h2>
            <p>
                We use a small number of essential cookies to keep your shopping cart and checkout working
                and to protect forms against misuse. We do not use advertising or third-party tracking cookies.
                You can block cookies in your browser, but the cart and checkout may not work without them.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 font-display text-ink">How long we keep it</h2>
            <p>
                We keep order records for as long as needed to fulfill your order and to meet our tax and
                accounting obligations. Unfinished checkout details are deleted after a short period.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 font-display text-ink">Your choices and rights</h2>
            <p>
                You may ask us to access, correct or delete the personal information we hold about you.
                Some information may need to be kept to meet legal obligations. To make a request, contact
                us using the email address below.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 font-display text-ink">Security</h2>
            <p>
                Our site is served over a secure (HTTPS) connection, and we take reasonable measures to
                protect your information. No method of transmission or storage is completely secure, however,
                so we cannot guarantee absolute security.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 font-display text-ink">Children's privacy</h2>
            <p>
                Our shop is not directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal
                information from them.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 font-display text-ink">Changes to this policy</h2>
            <p>
                We may update this policy from time to time. Changes take effect when posted on this page,
                and the date at the top will show when it was last revised.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 font-display text-ink">Contact us</h2>
            <p>
                Questions about this policy or your information? Email us at
                <a
                    x-data="{ user: 'support', domain: 'glimpsesofglory.art' }"
                    :href="'mailto:' + user + '@@' + domain"
                    x-text="user + '@@' + domain"
                    class="text-gold-dark hover:underline"
                >our support address</a>.
            </p>
        </section>
    </div>
</div>
